	<p>The browser for Cone's 3D web, ready to run, with SDL3 inside and no compiler needed. Unzip it anywhere and
	run it. Built from pegasus3d commit <code>b067da3</code>.</p>
	<table class="files">
	<tr><td>File</td><td><a href="downloads/@HASH8@/@BROWSER_FILE@">@BROWSER_FILE@</a> (@BROWSER_SIZE@)</td></tr>
	<tr><td>SHA-256</td><td><code class="hash">@BROWSER_SHA256@</code></td></tr>
	</table>
	<p><b>You need</b> Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit), a Vulkan-capable graphics card with up-to-date drivers, and about
	600 MB of RAM. The browser is not code-signed, so Windows SmartScreen will warn the first time you run it. The
	licenses of what it contains are in the zip.</p>
	<p>Multiplayer is by approval: press F9 in the browser to ask. Once you are approved, run it with
	<code>--connect 40.87.21.70:40000 --name &lt;you&gt;</code>.</p>
